  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion, carrot, and celery, and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Stir in the fenugreek leaves, turmeric, salt, and black pepper, and cook until the leaves are wilted.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together the apple cider vinegar and 1 tablespoon of water.",
    "Pour the vinegar mixture over the fenugreek mixture and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 10 minutes.",
    "Serve the mixture hot, garnished with additional fenugreek leaves if desired, in a lacquerware bowl."
